#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:4
msgid "轨迹显示"
msgstr "Track display"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:7
msgid "简介"
msgstr "Introduction"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:9
msgid "轨迹显示节点用于根据目标跟踪结果在图像上绘制运动轨迹线，可视化目标的历史移动路径。"
msgstr ""
"The trajectory display node is used to draw motion trajectory lines on the "
"image based on the target tracking results to visualize the historical "
"movement path of the target."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:11
msgid ""
"该节点需要配合目标跟踪模块使用，通过记录每个跟踪目标的历史位置，在图像上绘制出连续的轨迹线。支持多种颜色方案、轨迹长度和粗细配置，可清晰展示多个目标的运动轨迹。"
msgstr ""
"This node needs to be used with the target tracking module to draw a "
"continuous trajectory line on the image by recording the historical position"
" of each tracking target.Supports multiple color schemes, trajectory length "
"and thickness configurations to clearly display the movement trajectories of"
" multiple targets."

