msgstr "**Forecast Display**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:48
msgid "要可视化的跟踪模型预测结果，选择跟踪器的输出"
msgstr "To visualize tracking model predictions, select Tracker Output"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:49
msgid "从下拉菜单选择"
msgstr "Select from drop-down menu"

