msgstr ""
"Number of colors in the palette, applicable when using a custom or "
"Matplotlib palette"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:55
msgid "``10``"
msgstr "``10``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:56
#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:94
msgid "**自定义颜色**"
msgstr "**Custom Color**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:57
msgid "自定义颜色列表，使用HEX格式定义轨迹颜色"
msgstr "Custom color list, use HEX format to define track color"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:58
msgid "``[\"#FF0000\", \"#00FF00\", \"#0000FF\"]``"
msgstr "``[\"#FF0000\", \"#00FF00\", \"#0000FF\"]``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:59
#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:104
msgid "**颜色坐标轴**"
msgstr "**Color Axis**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:60
msgid "颜色分配的依据，通常基于跟踪ID（TRACK）来着色"
msgstr "The basis for color assignment, usually based on tracking ID (TRACK)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:61
msgid "``CLASS``"
msgstr "``CLASS``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:62
msgid "**坐标位置**"
msgstr "**Coordinate location**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:63
msgid "轨迹点的锚点位置，决定从目标的哪个位置绘制轨迹"
msgstr ""
"The anchor point position of the track point determines where the track is "
"drawn from on the target."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:64
msgid "``CENTER``"
msgstr "``CENTER``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:65
#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:113
msgid "**最大长度**"
msgstr "**Maximum length**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:66
msgid "显示的最大历史轨迹点数量"
msgstr "Maximum number of historical track points displayed"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:67
msgid "``80``"
msgstr "``80``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:68
msgid "**轨迹粗细**"
msgstr "**Track Thickness**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:69
msgid "轨迹线条的粗细（像素）"
msgstr "Track line thickness (pixels)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:70
msgid "``1``"
msgstr "``1``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:73
msgid "参数详细说明"
msgstr "Detailed description of parameters"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:77
msgid "**True**：创建图像副本，原始图像保持不变，可用于后续其他可视化操作"
msgstr ""
"**True**: Create a copy of the image, the original image remains unchanged "
"and can be used for other subsequent visualization operations"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:78
msgid "**False**：直接在原图上绘制，节省内存但会修改原图"
msgstr ""
"**False**: Draw directly on the original image, saving memory but modifying "
"the original image."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:80
msgid "当多个可视化节点共用同一输入图像时，建议启用此选项以避免可视化效果相互叠加。"
msgstr ""
"When multiple visualization nodes share the same input image, it is "
"recommended to enable this option to avoid visualizations overlapping each "
"other."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:84
msgid "选择要可视化的跟踪器输出结果。从下拉菜单中选择上游跟踪节点的输出，节点会根据跟踪ID记录每个目标的历史位置并绘制轨迹。"
msgstr ""
"Select the tracker output to visualize.Select the output of the upstream "
"tracking node from the drop-down menu, and the node will record the "
"historical position of each target based on the tracking ID and draw the "
"trajectory."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:88
msgid "支持多种颜色调色板方案："
msgstr "Supports multiple color palette schemes:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:90
msgid "``DEFAULT``：系统默认配色方案"
msgstr "``DEFAULT``: system default color scheme"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:91
msgid "``MATPLOTLIB``：使用Matplotlib的颜色方案"
msgstr "``MATPLOTLIB``: Use Matplotlib's color scheme"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:92
msgid "``CUSTOM``：使用自定义颜色列表（需配置自定义颜色参数）"
msgstr ""
"``CUSTOM``: Use a custom color list (custom color parameters need to be "
"configured)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:96
msgid "当调色板选择 ``CUSTOM`` 时，使用HEX格式定义颜色列表："
msgstr ""
"When ``CUSTOM`` is selected for the palette, use HEX format to define the "
"color list:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:102
msgid "分别对应红色、绿色、蓝色、黄色、紫色，颜色会按顺序分配给不同的跟踪目标。"
msgstr ""
"Corresponding to red, green, blue, yellow, and purple respectively, the "
"colors will be assigned to different tracking targets in order."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:106
msgid "决定如何为轨迹分配颜色："
msgstr "Decide how to assign colors to tracks:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:108
msgid "``CLASS``：根据物体类别着色，同类物体使用相同颜色"
msgstr ""
"``CLASS``: Color according to object category, similar objects use the same "
"color"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:109
msgid "``INDEX``：为每个物体分配不同颜色"
msgstr "``INDEX``: assign a different color to each object"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:110
msgid "``TRACK``：根据Tracker ID着色，每个Tracker ID使用不同颜色"
msgstr ""
"``TRACK``: Colored according to Tracker ID, use different colors for each "
"Tracker ID"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:115
msgid "设置每个跟踪目标保留的最大历史轨迹点数量。默认值为 ``80``。"
msgstr ""
"Set the maximum number of historical track points retained for each tracking"
" target.The default value is ``80``."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:117
msgid "``30``：较短的轨迹，显示近期移动路径"
msgstr "``30``: shorter trajectory showing recent movement path"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:118
msgid "``80``：标准长度（默认）"
msgstr "``80``: standard length (default)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:119
msgid "``150`` 及以上：较长的轨迹，显示更长的历史路径"
msgstr ""
"``150`` and above: longer trajectories, showing longer historical paths"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/trace_display.rst:121
msgid "轨迹长度越大，显示的历史移动路径越长，但占用的内存也越多。当目标移动缓慢时可以增大此值，移动快速时可以减小此值。"
msgstr ""
"The larger the trajectory length, the longer the historical movement path "
"displayed, but the more memory it takes up.You can increase this value when "
"the target is moving slowly, and decrease it when the target is moving fast."
